    "alltext": "70.\n75 INT. BABA'S ASHRAM-GUEST AUDIENCE CHAMBERS - DAY\nVEDA and GOVARDHAN are sent into CHINTHAN BABA's private\nchambers immediately. CHINTHAN BABA is in his early 40s.\nSlightly effeminate, but only to the trained eye. CHINTHAN\nBABA is seated on a recliner; he looks composed. As VEDA\nenters the room, CHINTHAN BABA acknowledges him with a nod.\nHe opens his eyes to see GOVARDHAN, soon after which his\nexpression changes. CHINTHAN BABA looks at him a split second\nlonger than usual and smiles a mildly strange smile. Only the\nreceiver of the smile would know its crookedness.\nCHINTHAN BABA\n(Looking at GOVARDHAN\nlongingly)\nMeelo VEDA SHANKAR evaru?\nVEDA wondering why CHINTHAN BABA is paying so much attention\nto GOVARDHAN.",
